          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.192,
                0.774,
                0.21
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1. 镰刀形贫血症是由于血红蛋白亚基的 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\beta"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 链上的 Val 突变成 Glu（×）"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.22,
                0.63,
                0.237
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. 嘧啶和嘌呤两类核苷酸合成都需要 Asn 和 Gln (×)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.303,
            0.254,
            0.32
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "四、填空题"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.331,
            0.643,
            0.46
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.331,
                0.599,
                0.348
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1. 离子强度提高和加入单链结合蛋白后 Km 的变化?"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 9,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.359,
                0.642,
                0.376
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. 植物脂肪处于液态是因为？和动物脂肪相比溶解温度？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.387,
                0.521,
                0.404
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3.依赖于  "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\rho"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "  因子的终止子具有什么酶功能？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.415,
                0.381,
                0.431
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4.基因工程操作需要的酶？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.442,
                0.603,
                0.459
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "5.蛋白质转录氨基酸的活化形势？催化该反应的酶？"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.498,
            0.848,
            0.655
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 14,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.498,
                0.837,
                0.515
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1. 稳定蛋白质空间构象的非共价键主要有盐键, 氢键, (疏水键) 和 (范德华力)。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 15,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.526,
                0.848,
                0.57
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. 结合蛋白酶类必须由酶蛋白和辅助因子相结合后才具有活性，（酶蛋白）决定酶的专一性，"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 16,
              "bbox": [
                0.155,
                0.581,
                0.524,
                0.598
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "（辅助因子）传递电子，原子及某些基因。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 17,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.61,
                0.744,
                0.626
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3. 体内的氧化呼吸链主要有（NADH 呼吸链）和（FADH2 呼吸链）。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 18,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.637,
                0.78,
                0.654
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4. 根据维生素的溶解性可以分为（脂溶性维生素）和（水溶性维生素）。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
